# DRAFT for the public learn-ukrainian/machinery repository (issue #12682).
# Install it there as the root .trufflehogignore; the secret-scan job of
# ci-gate.yml passes it to TruffleHog with --exclude-paths. A missing file is a
# scan error. prepublication-gate.sh passes this copy, beside it, to its
# pre-publication scans.
#
# One Go regular expression per line, matched against repository-relative
# paths. Comment and blank lines are skipped (TruffleHog 3.99.0
# pkg/common/filter.go). The Lob detector is excluded by flag in that
# secret-scan job, not here.
#
# There are no exclusions. Every pattern is a path the secret scan cannot
# see. Add one only for a reviewed false positive, anchored to the exact file,
# with the reason in a comment above it. The source repository's entries do
# not carry over: its site config is product content, and its lockfiles
# produce no TruffleHog 3.99.0 results even with unverified results reported
# (checked on uv.lock, requirements-lock.txt and .dagger/uv.lock, 2026-11-03).
